<%# 처음 접속 시 안내 인덱스 — 학생/교직원 로그인 선택 화면(sessions#new). %>
<div class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto text-center">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink">책갈피</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 mb-8 text-slate">어떻게 로그인할까요?</p>

  <div class="space-y-4">
    <%= link_to student_login_path,
          class: "card block bg-surface-featured text-center" do %>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-yellow-light text-4xl" aria-hidden="true">🧒</span>
      <span class="block text-xl font-bold text-ink">학생 로그인</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-brand-blue">학교·학급·이름으로 들어가요</span>
    <% end %>

    <%= link_to staff_login_path,
          class: "card block text-center" do %>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface text-4xl" aria-hidden="true">👩‍🏫</span>
      <span class="block text-xl font-bold text-ink">선생님 로그인</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-steel">교사·관리자·사서 이메일 로그인</span>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-8 text-sm">
    <%= link_to "교사 가입 신청", new_registration_path, class: "text-brand-blue underline" %>
  </p>
</div>
